# DESK30, the shortcut in use: cold-start the card the d30 run saved, then
# double-click the restored `QED.NAP` shortcut on the desktop. QED must start
# from it -- the shortcut's `a_pappl` (`C:\QED.NAP`) is the path that is run.
#
#   A_BOOT   the restored desktop, shortcut and saved window
#   C_QED    QED up, launched from the desktop icon
#
# Coordinate from the d30b probe: desk obj 12 box (182,433) 76x40 -> click
# (220,449).
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_BOOT
1600 move 220 449
1800 down
1803 up
1810 down
1813 up
2400 move 600 240
3300 mark C_QED
4500 mark D_QED
